WEBVTT

1
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.834
Democracy comes from the Greek root ''demos''...

2
00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:46.233
...meaning ''the people''...

3
00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:49.797
...and ''kratein'' meaning ''to rule''

4
