18
00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:18.799
Yang Qu-yun, the former leader of
the Revive China Society...

19
00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:22.231
...was gunned down on October 1st, 1901

20
00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:26.748
