24
00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.588
On October 1st, 1906

25
00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:49.437
Sun Yat-sen, aka Sun Wen, left Tokyo on
a perilous journey to Hong Kong...

26
00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:02.389
THE FORBlDDEN ClTY, BElJlNG

