But master...

187
00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.758
Support democracy!

188
00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:25.118
Support Dr. Sun!

189
00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:32.395
Support Dr. Sun!

190
00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:36.639
Bring democracy to China!

191
00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:39.873
Support Dr. Sun! Support...

192
