when you gave him these books?!

208
00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:03.075
He's my son, my only son!

209
00:22:06.480 --> 00:22:10.598
l was forty before l finally had a son!

210
00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:13.994
l gave him these two

211
